    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家都很喜欢的零食系列又来啦！今天小卖部里有什么，为大家准备的是：我们童年饮用的那些饮料。</span></p><p><span>作为一个从小就不爱喝白开水的孩子，多亏了这些饮料为我止渴，助我茁壮成长！</span></p><p><span>哪些是您小时候也喜欢的？又有哪些是我们没提到的您想与我们分享？评论区见呀。</span></p><p><span>欢迎收听本期节目。</span></p><p><span>⭐欢迎来这里找我们玩呀⭐</span></p><p><strong><span>🎀小红书：</span></strong><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/UjzqM0PlJG" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/UjzqM0PlJG"><strong><span>女宾两位</span></strong></a><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span>💖小红书：</span></strong><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/v6UVYKUOXN" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/v6UVYKUOXN"><strong><span>阿卡</span></strong></a></p><p><strong><span>☎️听友群&amp;商务请加：shower_two</span></strong></p><p><span>↓本期传送门↓</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a></span></strong><strong><span>-冲剂类</span></strong></p><p><span>高乐高/美禄/阿华田</span></p><p><span>必是/果珍Tang/雀巢咖啡与伴侣🥰</span></p><p><span>奶粉/酸梅晶/南方黑芝麻糊（为冒犯了的周同学道歉）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiH1vC2qZj1yxp3qSXhBsgxBxnpX.jpg"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1752">29:12</a></span></strong><strong><span>-奶制品</span></strong></p><p><span>子母奶=有人听说过吗？</span></p><p><span>AD钙奶/喜乐/三元瓷瓶酸奶</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqH8H9YW-gfgRbSB5iGLyywmHpJl.jpg"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a></span></strong><strong><span>-运动饮料</span></strong></p><p><span>尖叫/脉动/宝矿力水特/健力宝/旭日升</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgHxLLl9-A_WuSaYd13v2xhXCBdX.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flwr34UCItY5KfWwMLzHIxWDetAJ.jpg"><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3431">57:11</a></span></strong><strong><span>-玻璃瓶与软包装</span></strong></p><p><span>黑加仑/北冰洋/大亨果茶</span></p><p><span>摩奇/汇源/茹梦</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtVN7fJYad9sd9CrF8baFg_zDjaC.jpg"><p><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3995">66:35</a></span></strong><strong><span>-其他我们爱喝的</span></strong></p><p><span>椰树/露露/醒目/福运全酸枣汁/粒粒橙/雪碧冰薄荷